  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> For every point of Accrual you possess, all of your ability scores increase by 2 for the purpose of determining when you fall unconscious from ability damage. If the total ability damage dealt to one of your ability scores is less than or equal to twice the amount of Accrual you possess, ignore any penalties to the ability score from ability damage.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/accrual#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
